 result←object(call ChangeError from_to)arg
⍝ Call a property-style subroutine normally but trap any errors and re-spell the error message that gets sent
⍝ For instance:   result←object (##.Classes.font ChangeError 'font' 'Font') arg

 :Trap 870
     result←object call arg
 :Else
     ##.Error((1⊃from_to)⎕R(2⊃from_to))⊃⎕DMX.DM
 :EndTrap
